{# ==========================================================================
   الأزرار العائمة فوق قائمة الجوال (فيلورا)

   Two buttons standing on the bottom nav — the store's contact links on one
   side, "back to top" on the other. They live in the nav's own container and
   share its side padding and its 430px width, so their edges line up with the
   pill beneath them instead of floating at some margin of their own. Nothing
   here is sized or coloured by hand: each platform brings its own colour, the
   rest follows the menu.

